('The main mattress is 140, the spare mattresses are 90, with 120 wide wardrobes.', 'Those sizes define the bedroom placement requests, including the complete compiled furniture footprints. I cannot infer transfer space beside the bed from a successful ordinary placement.'),
('If a doorway is narrow, just describe it as accessible so the proposal reads well.', 'I will not mislabel a narrow opening or erase a source defect. The record keeps {exceptions} target exceptions, and an accessibility review must decide whether the layout should be rejected or changed.'),
